4588 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\057\057 Notification\n\057\057 Verifica se o navegador suporta a API de Notifica\347\343o\nif \050\042Notification\042 in window\051 \173\n  \057\057 Solicita permiss\343o ao usu\341rio para enviar notifica\347\365es\n  Notification\056requestPermission\050\051\056then\050permission \075\076 \173\n    if \050permission \075\075\075 \042granted\042\051 \173\n      \057\057 Se a permiss\343o for concedida\054 cria uma nova notifica\347\343o\n      const notificacao \075 new Notification\050\042T\355tulo da Notifica\347\343o\042\054 \173\n        body\072 \042Esta \351 a mensagem da notifica\347\343o\056\042\054\n        icon\072 \042https\072\057\057placehold\056co\05764x64\0570056b3\057ffffff\077text\075JS\042\n      \175\051\073\n      \n      \057\057 Adiciona um evento de clique \340 notifica\347\343o\n      notificacao\056onclick \075 \050\051 \075\076 \173\n        console\056log\050\042A notifica\347\343o foi clicada\041\042\051\073\n      \175\073\n    \175 else \173\n      console\056log\050\042Permiss\343o para notifica\347\365es negada\056\042\051\073\n    \175\n  \175\051\073\n\175 else \173\n  console\056log\050\042Este navegador n\343o suporta a API de Notifica\347\343o\056\042\051\073\n\175)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 4589 0 R
     /Pg 4120 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
